  {
   "start": 4.18,
   "end": 8.76,
   "text": "I took a wrong turn a thousand miles"
  },
  {
   "start": 8.76,
   "end": 9.26,
   "text": "back"
  },
  {
   "start": 14.7,
   "end": 17.6,
   "text": "But I let it go so long ago"
  },
  {
   "start": 22.31,
   "end": 23.01,
   "text": "of the mind."
  },
  {
   "start": 28.13,
   "end": 30.45,
   "text": "Should've known where I was going"
  },
  {
   "start": 34.32,
   "end": 39.01,
   "text": "And I should know where I am It's"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.01,
   "end": 42.29,
   "text": "a different place, a different face, a different"
  },
  {
   "start": 42.29,
   "end": 46.49,
   "text": "name, but somehow all the same."
  },
  {
   "start": 50.69,
   "end": 55.5,
   "text": "It's like a lost and found And when"
  },
  {
   "start": 55.5,
   "end": 60.1,
   "text": "I turn around, it's 2020."
  },
  {
   "start": 67.19,
   "end": 69.49,
   "text": "Well the fog was wrapped around me"
  },
  {
   "start": 73.47,
   "end": 78.78,
   "text": "Settled in for years Now the day has"
  },
  {
   "start": 78.78,
   "end": 84.52,
   "text": "pushed it all away The line"
  },
  {
   "start": 84.52,
   "end": 86.06,
   "text": "is getting clear"
  },
  {
   "start": 90.97,
   "end": 95.81,
   "text": "So I followed all the breadcrumbs Oh, and"
  },
  {
   "start": 95.81,
   "end": 101.8,
   "text": "I tried to find the track But"
  },
  {
   "start": 101.8,
   "end": 104.96,
   "text": "I can't return, that bridge was burned The"
  },
  {
   "start": 104.96,
   "end": 107.56,
   "text": "first time I went past, but I keep"
  },
  {
   "start": 107.56,
   "end": 111.08,
   "text": "looking back"
  },
  {
   "start": 113.67,
   "end": 119.21,
   "text": "Like lost and found When I turn"
  },
  {
   "start": 119.21,
   "end": 122.67,
   "text": "around It's 2020"
  },
  {
   "start": 122.67,
   "end": 148.26,
   "text": "♪"
  },
  {
   "start": 148.26,
   "end": 150.2,
   "text": "Don't regret what hasn't happened"
  },
  {
   "start": 154.64,
   "end": 160.57,
   "text": "I wonder what It's only memories I'll"
  },
  {
   "start": 160.57,
   "end": 164.03,
   "text": "never see, and places I won't go in"
  },
  {
   "start": 164.03,
   "end": 165.07,
   "text": "curiosity."
  },
  {
   "start": 170.69,
   "end": 176.32,
   "text": "Like a lost and found When I turn"
  },
  {
   "start": 176.32,
   "end": 179.98,
   "text": "around It's 2020"
  },
  {
   "start": 185.79,
   "end": 191.31,
   "text": "If I knew it then Run"
  },
  {
   "start": 191.31,
   "end": 194.89,
   "text": "again It's 2020."
  }
 ]
